      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Me and some of my friends also be having this issue. It doesn't appear to be something that can replicated anytime we like it to, it just randomly happens on its own quite often, maybe 5 times or so a day. I've also noticed that I couldn't press V to mute or unmute myself sometimes, with pressing escape to open and close the menu to fix it. Maybe those 2 issues are related in some way, idk. And yes it still happens as I typed this",
