      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "64a48558c0831a09a5d70f16",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I had the same problem a few weeks ago and managed to replicate it, I found the reason why it happens and it is not exactly random. The error occurs if when taking the mirror and simultaneously click on a text field or interactable area where you can enter or copy text and once you click inside you proceed to open the radial menu, this happens sometimes and it is impossible to open/close the menu again since every time you press the \"R\" key, only the text field is written. If the error occurs with the radial menu closed, just press ESC to exit the text field in question and it will allow you to interact without problem, if the error occurs with the radial menu open, a temporary solution that I found is to open the ChatBox and close it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
