  "details": "There’s no way to really reproduce it because it just happens randomly\n\nBut here’s a description of what happens\n\nI would be opening the radial menu to access expressions or put a personal mirror down and every now and then when I would hit the button to close the menu nothing would happen and if it was open I would have to navigate to the options to close the menu that way if it is stuck close I have to rejoin the world or access my expressions in the wings menu but if I have a personal mirror down well that’s out until I rejoin the world\n\nI don’t play on quest anymore so I’m not sure if it is effected by this glitch",
